# Async audio filters run before buffering: gain filter scales, a dropping filter discards the packet (nothing stored).
init 48000 2
clock 1000000000
timeline 1000000000
source a input
source f filter
filter a f 0.5 0
output a 48000 2 1024 1000000000 const 0.5
state a
render a 1
source g filter
filter a g 1 1
output a 48000 2 1024 1021333333 const 0.5
state a
